<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-RESULTS IN THE SPANISH CUP SECOND ROUND, SECOND LEG.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-RESULTS IN THE SPANISH CUP SECOND ROUND, SECOND LEG.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the second leg of the</p>
<p>second round of the Spanish Cup on Wednesday.</p>
<p> Real Sociedad	 1    Osasuna	    1</p>
<p>(Osasuna win 2-1 on aggregate)</p>
<p> Valladolid	    1    Talavera	   1</p>
<p>(Valladolid win 4-1 on aggregate)</p>
<p> Athletic Bilbao     2    Zalla		1</p>
<p>(Athletic win 5-1 on aggregate)</p>
<p> Racing Santander    0    Eibar		0</p>
<p>(1-1 on aggregate, Racing win on away goals rule)</p>
<p> Logrones		0    Alaves	     0</p>
<p>(1-1 on aggregate, Logrones win on away goals rule)</p>
<p> Oviedo		  3    Aviles	     0</p>
<p>(Oviedo win 8-1 on aggregate)</p>
<p> Compostela	    1    Leganes	    0</p>
<p>(Compostela win 2-1 on aggregate)</p>
<p> Real Madrid	   2    Salamanca	  0</p>
<p>(Real Madrid win 4-0 on aggregate)</p>
<p> Sevilla		 0    Malaga	     0</p>
<p>(Sevilla win 1-0 on aggregate)</p>
<p> Real Betis	    2    Ecija		0</p>
<p>(Betis win 4-1 on aggregate)</p>
<p> Rayo Vallecano	5    Albacete	   1</p>
<p>(Rayo win 5-1 on aggregate)</p>
<p> Deportivo Coruna    3    Mallorca	   0</p>
<p>(Deportivo win 3-1 on aggregate)</p>
<p> Extremadura	   5    Merida	     1</p>
<p>(Extremadura win 5-2 on aggregate)</p>
<p> Hercules		2    Levante	    0</p>
<p>(Hercules win 2-1 on aggregate)</p>
<p> Zaragoza		2    Real Union	 1</p>
<p>(Zaragoza win 6-1 on aggregate)</p>
</text>
